        ↓
       ┌───────────────────────┐
       │ Find by HEADER NAME   │
       └───────────────────────┘
        ↓
RunId          → "Run ID"
PipelineName   → "Pipeline name"
Status         → "Status"
RunStart       → "Run start"
RunEnd         → "Run end"
